{
  "format": "ovis-conformance/1",
  "scenario": "remote/e2e",
  "title": "Remote requests reach only their machine: a second private runtime added over a real authenticated stdio transport, isolated when it stalls",
  "todo": 52,
  "closes": [
    "GAP-106",
    "GAP-109"
  ],
  "delivers": [
    "IDEAL-080",
    "IDEAL-083"
  ],
  "excludes": [
    "EXCL-014",
    "EXCL-016"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "linux",
    "macos"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "case": "happy",
      "summary": "The peer runtime (this runner re-run as `fixture --peer`, its own authority, store and machine id ...c3) is added with the real machine.add over an argv transport that runs the binary under test as `ovis-terminal connect`; the hello boot proof answers a fresh challenge. machine.list lists it connected. terminal.run with machine {name: peer} and peer/parent addresses reach only the peer: the peer's parent exits while the local parent of the same name stays live at incarnation 1 with no kills. The peer process is then SIGSTOPped: a call to it ends deadline_exceeded at the 3 s remote deadline while machine.list and a local call answer; after SIGCONT the same line still serves the peer (the server now honours the actor's $/cancelRequest instead of closing the connection).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "serve": {
            "fixture": "protocol"
          }
        },
        {
          "connect": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "via": "bridge"
          }
        },
        {
          "hello": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "framed": false,
            "expect": {
              "/id": "hello",
              "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000021"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "describe",
                "method": "fixture.peer",
                "params": {
                  "action": "describe"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "describe": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
                "/result/argv": {
                  "$capture": "peer_argv"
                },
                "/result/credential": {
                  "$capture": "peer_credential"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "add-peer",
                "method": "machine.add",
                "params": {
                  "op_id": "$op:add-peer",
                  "name": "peer",
                  "transport": {
                    "argv": "$value:peer_argv"
                  },
                  "credential": "$value:peer_credential",
                  "expected_machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "add-peer": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
                "/result/name": "peer",
                "/result/state": "connected"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "roster",
                "method": "machine.list",
                "params": {}
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "roster": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/machines/2/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
                "/result/machines/2/state": "connected",
                "/result/machines/3": {
                  "$present": false
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "run-local",
                "method": "terminal.run",
                "params": {
                  "op_id": "$op:run-local",
                  "program": {
                    "argv": [
                      "agent"
                    ]
                  },
                  "geometry": {
                    "cols": 80,
                    "rows": 24
                  },
                  "name": "parent"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "run-local": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/terminal_id": {
                  "$capture": "run-local_terminal"
                },
                "/result/process_incarnation": "1"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "run-peer",
                "method": "terminal.run",
                "params": {
                  "op_id": "$op:run-peer",
                  "program": {
                    "argv": [
                      "agent"
                    ]
                  },
                  "geometry": {
                    "cols": 80,
                    "rows": 24
                  },
                  "name": "parent",
                  "machine": {
                    "name": "peer"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "run-peer": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/terminal_id": {
                  "$capture": "run-peer_terminal"
                },
                "/result/process_incarnation": "1"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "peer-exits",
                "method": "fixture.exit",
                "params": {
                  "target": {
                    "address": "peer/parent"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "peer-exits": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/finished": "recorded"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "local-live",
                "method": "fixture.program",
                "params": {
                  "target": {
                    "name": "parent"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "local-live": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/live": true,
                "/result/incarnation": "1",
                "/result/kills": "0"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "peer-ended",
                "method": "fixture.program",
                "params": {
                  "target": {
                    "address": "peer/parent"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "peer-ended": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/live": false,
                "/result/incarnation": "1"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "stall",
                "method": "fixture.peer",
                "params": {
                  "action": "stop"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "stall": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/stopped": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "peer-stalls",
                "method": "fixture.program",
                "params": {
                  "target": {
                    "address": "peer/parent"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "roster-during-stall",
                "method": "machine.list",
                "params": {}
              },
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "local-during-stall",
                "method": "fixture.program",
                "params": {
                  "target": {
                    "name": "parent"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "peer-stalls": {
                "/error/data/kind": "deadline_exceeded",
                "/result": {
                  "$present": false
                }
              },
              "roster-during-stall": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/machines/2/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
                "/result/machines/2/state": "connected"
              },
              "local-during-stall": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/live": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "resume",
                "method": "fixture.peer",
                "params": {
                  "action": "resume"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "resume": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/stopped": false
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "peer-after-stall",
                "method": "fixture.program",
                "params": {
                  "target": {
                    "address": "peer/parent"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "peer-after-stall": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/live": false
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "hangup": {
            "conn": "bridge"
          }
        },
        {
          "closed": {
            "conn": "bridge"
          }
        },
        {
          "stop": {
            "expect": {
              "/panicked": "0"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "failure",
      "summary": "machine.add with a credential the peer never issued is auth_failed and with another expected machine id is trust_mismatch; neither records a machine. After the peer is added, an address qualified by an unknown machine is not_found at params.target.address and nothing runs locally, and an observe-only principal's input.send to peer/parent is forbidden before anything is sent to the peer.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "serve": {
            "fixture": "protocol"
          }
        },
        {
          "connect": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "via": "bridge"
          }
        },
        {
          "hello": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "framed": false,
            "expect": {
              "/id": "hello",
              "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000021"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "send": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "requests": [
              {
                "jsonrpc": "2.0",
                "id": "describe",
                "method": "fixture.peer",
                "params": {
                  "action": "describe"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "replies": {
            "conn": "bridge",
            "expect": {
              "describe": {
                "/error": {
                  "$present": false
                },
                "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-0000000000c3",
                "/result/argv": {
                  "$capture": "peer_argv"
                },
                "/result/credential": {
                  "$capture": "peer_credential"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
